    dest="Delhi is a city of floors and colonies. Many families from Indore move into builder floors in areas such as Dwarka, Rohini, Janakpuri or Lajpat Nagar, often with a narrow staircase and no lift, while others settle in group housing societies with lifts and booking rules. Goods vehicles face entry restrictions on many Delhi roads during the day, so the verified partner team in Delhi times the delivery to the permitted hours. In winter, when the stricter stages of the Graded Response Action Plan are in force, older diesel trucks may be kept out, and the coordinator checks the vehicle before fixing the date.",
    tip="If the Delhi flat is on an upper floor of a builder block without a lift, tell the coordinator at the survey. The crew size and carrying time are then planned in, and nothing is added on the day.",
